invariant: INV-5
file: x509_pem.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: the Certificate SEQUENCE's length is read and not held to the
  bytes the certificate holds, so a certificate whose length claims fewer
  bytes than its fields fill reads. test_certificate_framing shortens the
  length by one and by two and requires a refusal.

--- old
    if (!x509_read_header(&r, TAG_SEQUENCE, &body_len) || body_len != rb_left(&r)) {
--- new
    if (!x509_read_header(&r, TAG_SEQUENCE, &body_len)) {
